\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Fig.2. Geant4-TCAD coupled simulation workflow. Geant4 provides the beta-electron energy-deposition distribution in 4H-SiC. This distribution is converted into an electron-hole-pair generation rate and used as the transient TCAD source term. The CCE is finally obtained by current integration.}}{3}{figure.caption.7}\protected@file@percent }
